# The Indus Group Website — Cursor Rules

Read these rules fully before generating any code.

## Project

Redesign of The Indus Group of Co. website.
Content source: theindusgroup.com | Design reference: axoncsipl.com
Next.js 14+ App Router, TypeScript. Styling TBD — do not assume any CSS framework.

## Pages

| Route | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `/` | Hero (tagline), Who We Are snapshot, 5 vertical cards, stats, testimonials, contact CTA |
| `/about` | Company story, mission/vision, MSME approach, key stats |
| `/businesses` | Grid of all 5 verticals |
| `/businesses/logistics` | Logistics & Supply Chain detail |
| `/businesses/enterprise-solutions` | Enterprise Solutions detail |
| `/businesses/skill-development` | Skill Development detail |
| `/businesses/real-estate` | Real Estate & Infra detail |
| `/businesses/hbc-franchise` | HBC Brand Franchise detail + enquiry |
| `/knowledge-center` | Articles and industry insights |
| `/resources` | Downloadable resources |
| `/tools` | Interactive tools |
| `/contact` | Form, phone (+91 7011332238), email, socials |

## Where files go

- `src/app/[route]/page.tsx` — page files, one folder per route
- `src/components/ui/` — reusable primitives (Button, Card, etc.)
- `src/components/sections/[page]/` — page-specific sections
- `src/components/layout/Header/` and `Footer/` — site-wide layout
- `src/lib/utils.ts` — shared utilities
- `src/types/index.ts` — shared types (BusinessVertical union type is here)
- `public/images/[category]/` — images

## Key data

- Company: The Indus Group of Co.
- Tagline: "Delivering industry-leading solutions across verticals with reliability, innovation, and integrity."
- Phone: +91 7011332238 | Email: info@theindusgroup.com
- Stats: 14+ yrs | 1,000+ clients | 100+ team | Global network | 24/7 support
- Socials: Instagram, LinkedIn, X, YouTube, WhatsApp

## Rules

- Named function exports only
- Props interface in same file: `[Name]Props`
- Folders: kebab-case | Components: PascalCase | Variables: camelCase
- No new packages or CSS frameworks without confirming stack
- Don't create files outside the structure above without asking
